  "icon": "🏪",
  "description": "I've been an esthetician since 1995, and I still absolutely love what I do. Whether it's helping someone clear up stubborn acne or customizing an anti-aging treatment that actually works, my goal is always the same — to help you feel confident in your skin. I'm big on results, but I also believe skincare should feel relaxing and personal. I'll always take the time to tailor your treatments and recommend the best at-home routine to keep your skin happy between visits. Sometimes your skin just needs more than a product. It needs a professional touch. With over 30 years of experience, I combine advanced technique with personalized care to restore your skin's natural radiance. Signature facials, gentle chemical peels, microchanneling, teen treatments and more. Every service is intended to leave you glowing, relaxed, and confident. Your skin deserves this.",
